	(text "Standalone programming: image in U27 (SPI NAND, also records traces), GO starts it, PASS / FAIL / buzzer report it, STOP cuts the target.\nField bus on J9: CAN FD (U28) or RS-485 (U29), picked by FIELD_SEL_485 (low = CAN, also the reset state)."
